    "text": "A data engineer needs to improve query performance on a 5 TB table that is frequently filtered by a `region` column and a `transaction_date` column. The `region` column has 10 distinct values and `transaction_date` has approximately 1,800 distinct values. What is the recommended column order for the clustering key?",
